Subject: [PATCH] AI_AB_TEST Economy: TrueGoldRate and WarChest candidate
 flags, on War's TimingBuildup (ai/war 2a4dde1)

TrueGoldRate: bankruptcy checks use the net gold rate (CP adds the average of positive income only), same as patch 0013 but on ai/war's flag list. WarChest: a timing attacker saves gold while its attack is planned (the agreed target: units still wanted x unit price, capped at 15 turns of net income, at least 2 siege units), buys one missing unit a turn in the window, and favours gold buildings while its army stands and gold per turn is negative. Both off in the bundle. War gates its own stand-in saving and buying on FIX_WAR_CHEST.

